---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Evonera Technologies" description="Privacy policy for Evonera Technologies Pvt Ltd and project inquiries.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 font-sans">
    <div class="mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-white/10">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-yellow-300">Data Protection</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-medium text-neutral-100 mt-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-faint mt-2">Evonera Technologies Pvt Ltd · Last updated: October 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-neutral-300 space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          The project form prepares an email draft in your email app. If you choose to send it, the details you include (such as your name, email address, project link, and description) are sent to Evonera Technologies Pvt Ltd so we can respond to your inquiry. The website does not store the form contents.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use details you send exclusively for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-400">
          <li>Preparing technical project briefs, architecture proposals, and pricing quotes.</li>
          <li>Direct communication regarding your consultation or active sprint.</li>
          <li>We do not sell, rent, or trade your contact information.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">3. Non-Disclosure & Code Confidentiality</h2>
        <p>
          Please do not include passwords, API keys, or other secrets in your inquiry. Before any project access is shared, agree with Evonera on the access needed and any confidentiality terms for the engagement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">4. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy inquiries, please contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@evonera.net" class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4">privacy@evonera.net</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
